LICENSE — From Absolute Zero companion repository

This repository holds material under four sets of terms. LICENSING.md is the authoritative map of
which files fall under which; the full licence texts are in LICENSES/.

1. SOURCE CODE AND EXECUTABLE MATERIAL ............................ MIT (LICENSES/MIT.txt)
   code/, notebooks/, bridges/, scripts/, tests/, figures/sources/*.py, and every starter, solution
   and check file under practice/exercises/.

2. GENERATED DATASETS ............................................. MIT (LICENSES/MIT.txt)
   data/generated/*.csv: entirely synthetic, produced by the code above, no personal or real-world data.

3. BOOK-DERIVED TEXT ................................. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt)
   The interview questions and answer notes (practice/bank/ and the pages generated from it), the
   mock-interview sets, the exercise READMEs, reference/cheatsheets/, reference/ai-assistant-prompts.md,
   the guides in reference/git/ and reference/portfolio/, and the documentation in docs/ and README.md.
   Copyright (c) 2026 Shanmukh Behara.

4. TEMPLATES MEANT TO BE COPIED ................................... CC0 1.0 (LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt)
   reference/templates/ and practice/tracker.csv.

NOT LICENSED BY THIS FILE

